		expression load_HMIS = ```
				let
				  Source = Excel.Workbook(
				    Web.Contents(
				      "https://apmus.sharepoint.com/sites/DataandInsights/Shared Documents/Power BI Source Files/RHAP/Load/HMIS IWP Report.xlsx"
				    ), 
				    null, 
				    true
				  ),
				    Data_sheet = Source{0}[Data]
				in
				    Data_sheet
				```
